    <briefdescription>
<para>Adjust PSA configuration by resolving some dependencies. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is an internal header. Do not include it directly.</para><para>See docs/proposed/psa-conditional-inclusion-c.md. If the Mbed TLS implementation of a cryptographic mechanism A depends on a cryptographic mechanism B then if the cryptographic mechanism A is enabled and not accelerated enable B. Note that if A is enabled and accelerated, it is not necessary to enable B for A support. </para>    </detaileddescription>
